The [[Magic Torch]] is a neutral [[Weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Torch]] or [[Burning Torch]] with a [[Mana Potion]]. On hit, it spends a {{icon/mana}} to permanently buff the damage of itself and any adjacent weapons slightly.

While it isn't better than the [[Torch]] or [[Burning Torch]], strictly speaking, it is substantially more damaging than those options, as long as the player has access to {{icon/mana}}.

Starting in version 1.1.3, the [[Burning Torch]] + [[Mana Potion]] recipe was added, presumably to be more consistent with the recipes available for crafting the [[Electric Torch]].
